          </p>
          <p class="card__links">{calendarLinksFor(e).every((link) => link.type === 'book') && <span class="card__soon">Our case file on this is in progress.</span>} {calendarLinksFor(e).map((link) => <CalendarExplainerLink link={link} />)} <a class="card__help" href="/support/">Victim &amp; Reader Resources</a>
